[node name="LooksSockVacuum" type="Node3D" unique_id=2143926739]
editor_description = "assets/24: the Sock vacuum's Looks (docs/architecture/devices.md \"Looks contracts\"). Front +Z, the origin on the floor under the canister's middle. Tip carries the whole container: the pour clip tips it 70 degrees forward about the body's middle (played backwards to stand it up again)."

